<header class="kube-library-header">
  <div class="kube-library-container">
    <p class="kube-label">The KubeDaily journal</p>
    <h1>Understand more.<br /><span>Build with confidence.</span></h1>
    <p class="kube-library-intro">Practical explanations of containers, Kubernetes, and the decisions behind reliable systems. Pick a topic, take your time, and keep a useful guide close.</p>
    <div class="kube-library-links"><a href="#guide-library">Browse <%= length(@posts) %> guides ↓</a><a href="/labs/">Prefer hands-on practice? Explore labs →</a></div>
  </div>
</header>

<section id="guide-library" class="kube-library-container kube-library-section" data-content-library>
  <div class="kube-library-toolbar">
    <div><p class="kube-label">Read & understand</p><h2>The guide library</h2></div>
    <div class="kube-library-search" hidden data-library-controls>
      <label for="guide-search">Find a guide</label>
      <input id="guide-search" type="search" placeholder="Search titles, topics, or keywords…" data-library-search />
    </div>
  </div>
  <p class="kube-library-count" role="status" data-library-count><%= length(@posts) %> guides to explore</p>
  <div class="kube-blog-grid">
    <%= for post <- @posts do %>
      <article class="kube-blog-card" data-library-card>
        <div class="kube-blog-card-top"><p class="kube-label"><%= post["category"] %></p><time><%= post["date"] %></time></div>
        <h3><a href={"/blog/#{post["id"]}/"}><%= post["title"] %></a></h3>
        <p><%= post["excerpt"] %></p>
        <div class="kube-blog-card-tags"><%= for tag <- Enum.take(post["tags"], 3) do %><span><%= tag %></span><% end %></div>
        <a class="kube-blog-card-link" href={"/blog/#{post["id"]}/"}>Read guide <span aria-hidden="true">→</span></a>
      </article>
    <% end %>
  </div>
  <p class="kube-library-empty" hidden data-library-empty>No guides match that search. Try “Docker” or “Kubernetes”, or clear the search to see everything.</p>
</section>

<section class="kube-library-container kube-library-footer">
  <div><p class="kube-label">Better together</p><h2>Have a clearer explanation?</h2><p>Fix a confusing paragraph, share a field note, or help a reader take the next step.</p></div>
  <a href="https://github.com/kubernetesdaily/kubernetesdaily.github.io/blob/main/CONTRIBUTING.md">Contribute a guide →</a>
</section>
